<title>USA: Kansas school bonds won by Hutchinson at 5.195 pct.</title>
<headline>Kansas school bonds won by Hutchinson at 5.195 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchinson Shockey Erley &amp; Co said Monday it won $30 million Unified School District No 512, Kan., general obligation bonds at a net interest cost of 5.195 percent.</p>
</text>
